### get all books
GET http://localhost:5050/books?limit=2&page=2 HTTP/1.1

### create book
POST http://localhost:5050/books HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "da vinci code",
    "price": 10.00,
    "author_id": 2
}

### patch books
PATCH http://localhost:5050/books/5 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "price": 10.99
}